    "summary": "You can use Heroic Intervention on the Maulerfiend’s unit after another unit has used it that phase. Reduce the cost of this use by 1 CP. Other units can still use the Stratagem that phase. When the Maulerfiend’s unit charges, check whether a friendly PSYKER unit up to 12″ from it was charged. If so it can re-roll its Charge roll, and must end its Charge move against the enemy that charged the PSYKER.",
